     "person": "pep",
     "label": "Liverpool 2019",
     "value": "97"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "In this world, those could be Liverpool titles. And United's long wait for a league title? Maybe it never happens.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "whatif",
    "title": "2016 TO 2026",
    "real": {
     "label": "Real world",
     "value": "City 6 titles"
    },
